[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "start": 0.3,
    "end": 2.3,
    "text": "Can I help you?"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": 2.3,
    "end": 4.3,
    "text": "Yeah, I found this."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": 4.3,
    "end": 6.3,
    "text": "I was cleaning out some drawers and stuff."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": 6.3,
    "end": 8.3,
    "text": "My mother gave it to me years ago,"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": 8.3,
    "end": 11.3,
    "text": "and I was wanting to find out how much it was worth."
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": 11.3,
    "end": 13.3,
    "text": "I think it was crazy. What is it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": 13.3,
    "end": 15.3,
    "text": "It's a black widow."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": 15.3,
    "end": 17.3,
    "text": "Is it poisonous?"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": 19.3,
    "end": 21.3,
    "text": "I just came to the pawn shop today"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": 21.3,
    "end": 23.3,
    "text": "to try to sell my grandmother's brooch"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": 23.3,
    "end": 25.3,
    "text": "that was given to me years ago."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": 25.3,
    "end": 27.3,
    "text": "It's just a spider brooch."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": 27.3,
    "end": 29.3,
    "text": "It's got a lot of crystals and stuff on it."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": 29.3,
    "end": 31.2,
    "text": "so I just wanted to get rid of it."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": 31.2,
    "end": 32.5,
    "text": "Do you know what you have here?"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": 32.5,
    "end": 33.8,
    "text": "No, not at all."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": 33.8,
    "end": 35.8,
    "text": "This is Faberge."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": 35.8,
    "end": 39.5,
    "text": "Faberge was one of the most famous jewelry designers"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": 39.5,
    "end": 40.8,
    "text": "in the world."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": 40.8,
    "end": 43.1,
    "text": "He was the jeweler to the Russian court."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": 43.1,
    "end": 45.9,
    "text": "This is something right here."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": 45.9,
    "end": 48.6,
    "text": "When people say Faberge, they mean Peter Faberge,"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": 48.6,
    "end": 51.0,
    "text": "one of the greatest jewelers of all time."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": 51.0,
    "end": 53.0,
    "text": "This guy became famous for his Faberge eggs,"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": 53.0,
    "end": 55.1,
    "text": "but he actually made everything from silverware"
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": 55.1,
    "end": 56.7,
    "text": "to necklaces to rings."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": 56.7,
    "end": 58.2,
    "text": "And just about anything he touched"
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": 58.2,
    "end": 60.04,
    "text": "is considered a masterpiece."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": 60.04,
    "end": 62.48,
    "text": "What you have here is pre-revolution"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": 62.48,
    "end": 64.34,
    "text": "Russian imperial jewelry."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "start": 64.34,
    "end": 66.04,
    "text": "That's onyx underneath there."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "start": 66.04,
    "end": 68.72,
    "text": "This white metal right here, that is all platinum."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "start": 68.72,
    "end": 70.22,
    "text": "Those are diamonds."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "start": 70.22,
    "end": 71.76,
    "text": "There's sapphires in the feet."
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "start": 71.76,
    "end": 73.72,
    "text": "Those are rubies in the eyes."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "start": 73.72,
    "end": 76.12,
    "text": "This is the kind of stuff that royalty wears."
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "start": 76.12,
    "end": 77.42,
    "text": "It's absolutely beautiful."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "start": 77.42,
    "end": 79.6,
    "text": "I can't believe this woman had a Faberge brooch"
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "start": 79.6,
    "end": 81.3,
    "text": "sitting around her to draw somewhere."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "start": 81.3,
    "end": 83.76,
    "text": "This is the one thing everyone hopes they'll stumble across"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "start": 83.76,
    "end": 85.26,
    "text": "when they're going through grandma's stuff."
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "start": 85.26,
    "end": 86.56,
    "text": "What did you want to do with it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "start": 86.56,
    "end": 87.74,
    "text": "I want to get rid of it."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "start": 87.74,
    "end": 89.48,
    "text": "And how much were you looking to get out of it?"
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "start": 89.48,
    "end": 91.08,
    "text": "A couple thousand?"
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "start": 91.08,
    "end": 93.24,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "start": 93.24,
    "end": 96.7,
    "text": "I would really, really like to give you, like,"
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "start": 96.7,
    "end": 99.56,
    "text": "2,000 bucks for it, but, um..."
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "start": 99.56,
    "end": 101.8,
    "text": "Unfortunately, I have a conscience."
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "start": 101.8,
    "end": 105.98,
    "text": "All right, um..."
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "start": 105.98,
    "end": 107.98,
    "text": "I'll cut to the chase."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "start": 107.98,
    "end": 109.98,
    "text": "I'll give you $15,000 for it."
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "start": 109.98,
    "end": 112.78,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "start": 112.78,
    "end": 114.86,
    "text": "Oh, my God, you got to be shitting me."
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "start": 114.86,
    "end": 117.7,
    "text": "No, I'm not. It's..."
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "start": 117.7,
    "end": 120.7,
    "text": "This is stuff you do not see every day."
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "start": 120.7,
    "end": 122.7,
    "text": "How about 17?"
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "start": 122.7,
    "end": 124.7,
    "text": "A man that's willing to pay 15"
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "start": 124.7,
    "end": 126.7,
    "text": "will definitely pay 17 for that."
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "start": 126.7,
    "end": 128.7,
    "text": "No, he won't. I mean, I mean, literally..."
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "start": 128.7,
    "end": 129.7,
    "text": "All right, how about 16?"
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "start": 129.7,
    "end": 131.7,
    "text": "I will give you 15."
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "start": 131.7,
    "end": 133.7,
    "text": "That's more than a fair offer on this."
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "start": 133.7,
    "end": 135.7,
    "text": "How about 15.5?"
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "start": 135.7,
    "end": 137.7,
    "text": "This is why I hate having a conscience."
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "start": 137.7,
    "end": 139.7,
    "text": "This is Vegas, and I just told this woman"
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "start": 139.7,
    "end": 142.7,
    "text": "she hit the jackpot, and now she wants another spin."
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "start": 142.7,
    "end": 144.7,
    "text": "I can pay you 15 grand."
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "start": 144.7,
    "end": 146.7,
    "text": "That's more than a fair offer on this."
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "start": 146.7,
    "end": 149.7,
    "text": "This is not something that's going to sell overnight."
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "start": 155.05,
    "end": 156.5,
    "text": "All right, you're a good man."
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "start": 156.5,
    "end": 157.5,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "start": 157.5,
    "end": 158.5,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "start": 158.5,
    "end": 159.5,
    "text": "Oh, my God."
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "start": 159.5,
    "end": 160.5,
    "text": "I'm so shocked."
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "start": 160.5,
    "end": 161.5,
    "text": "I mean, I couldn't believe it."
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "start": 161.5,
    "end": 162.5,
    "text": "It was worth $15,000."
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "start": 162.5,
    "end": 163.7,
    "text": "I had the jackpot today."
  }
]